title: Paul Levi
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor
view-if: adv_show_levi = 1
new-page: true

= Paul Levi

A Frankfurt lawyer, Luxemburg's defender in court and her closest ally. Cool, organised and impatient with fools, he wants a disciplined mass party that wins the majority of the workers before it reaches for power.

[? if levi_chair = 1 : He chairs the Zentrale now, and carries Luxemburg's legacy like a weight. ?]

- @organise
- @open_letter
- @root: Return to main

@organise
title: Organise the Apparatus
subtitle: The three least loyal districts move closer to the Zentrale.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
var sorted = Q.districts.slice().sort(function(a, b) {
    return Q['district_' + a + '_loyalty'] - Q['district_' + b + '_loyalty'];
});
for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
    Q['district_' + sorted[i] + '_loyalty'] += 12;
}
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

Levi builds a network of district secretaries who answer to the Zentrale, and reads every report they send.

@open_letter
title: Appeal to the Other Workers' Parties
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Proposes common demands to the social democrats and the unions. The Left calls it opportunism.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?][? if lock_united_front = 2 : The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any deal with the social democrats. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and lock_united_front < 2
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.spd_relation += 5;
Q.uspd_relation += 5;
Q.worker_support += 3;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 5;
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction -= 5;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

Levi drafts a letter to every workers' party and union: bread, wages, the disarming of the counter-revolution. Let them refuse it in front of their own members.
